%% M1 current local architecture; ensemble execution and physical capture remain planned.
flowchart LR
  Person[Visitor / authenticated user]
  Browser[React + TypeScript browser]
  Google[Google Identity Provider]
  Firebase[Firebase Authentication]
  API[FastAPI M1 API]
  Verifier[Firebase Admin SDK token and user verification]
  DB[(Trusted application SQLite data)]
  Files[(Private server media directory)]
  Ensemble[Ensemble separation subsystem]

  Person --> Browser
  Browser -->|Email/password or Google flow| Firebase
  Google --> Firebase
  Firebase -->|ID token| Browser
  Browser -->|Bearer token + resource request| API
  API --> Verifier
  Verifier -->|Verified UID and current provider state| API
  API -->|Resolve role, owner, grant, assignment| DB
  API -->|Authorized opaque resource ID only| Files
  Files -->|Authorized bytes| API
  API --> Browser
  API -.->|503 until executor is connected| Ensemble

  subgraph Trust[Trust boundary]
    API
    Verifier
    DB
    Files
  end
  note[Admin role grants safe account metadata only; audio still requires ownership or explicit grant.]
  DB --- note
